// Syncthing ignore patterns for this folder.
//
// CRITICAL: never let Syncthing sync the git database. Syncthing copies .git
// file-by-file and races / partially updates it, which corrupts the object
// store. Symptoms: "packfile ... index unavailable", or a commit capturing a
// stale tree (index overwritten mid-commit). Sync code between machines with
// git push / git pull via the remote instead - not file-based.
/.git

// Machine-local build / history / cache artifacts: no value in syncing, and
// they cause constant churn.
/firmware_honey-jar-filler/build
**/.history
**/__pycache__
**/.cache
